  "bug_info": "Summary of configuration for Project: Math\n--------------------------------------------------------------------------------\n    Script dir: /root/defects4j/framework\n      Base dir: /root/defects4j\n    Major root: /root/defects4j/major\n      Repo dir: /root/defects4j/project_repos\n--------------------------------------------------------------------------------\n    Project ID: Math\n       Program: commons-math\n    Build file: /root/defects4j/framework/projects/Math/Math.build.xml\n--------------------------------------------------------------------------------\n           Vcs: Vcs::Git\n    Repository: /root/defects4j/project_repos/commons-math.git\n     Commit db: /root/defects4j/framework/projects/Math/active-bugs.csv\nNumber of bugs: 106\n--------------------------------------------------------------------------------\n\nSummary for Bug: Math-45\n--------------------------------------------------------------------------------\nRevision ID (fixed version):\n5e6389761c6575f815a5ac91a22c4ecc48596729\n--------------------------------------------------------------------------------\nRevision date (fixed version):\n2011-10-10 19:56:03 +0000\n--------------------------------------------------------------------------------\nBug report id:\nMATH-679\n--------------------------------------------------------------------------------\nBug report url:\nhttps://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/MATH-679\n--------------------------------------------------------------------------------\nRoot cause in triggering tests:\n - org.apache.commons.math.linear.OpenMapRealMatrixTest::testMath679\n   --> junit.framework.AssertionFailedError: Expected exception: org.apache.commons.math.exception.NumberIsTooLargeException\n--------------------------------------------------------------------------------\nList of modified sources:\n - org.apache.commons.math.linear.OpenMapRealMatrix\n--------------------------------------------------------------------------------",
  "bug_report_content": "Title: Integer overflow in OpenMapRealMatrix\nType: Bug | Priority: Minor | Status: Closed | Resolution: Fixed\n\nDescription:\ncomputeKey() has an integer overflow. Since it is a sparse matrix, this is quite easily encountered long before heap space is exhausted. The attached code demonstrates the problem, which could potentially be a security vulnerability (for example, if one was to use this matrix to store access control information).\n\nWorkaround: never create an OpenMapRealMatrix with more cells than are addressable with an int.\n\nComments:\n\n[Christopher Berner]: Move code to an attachment\n\n[Luc Maisonobe]: Fixed in subversion repository as of r1181181.\n\nThanks for the report and the workaround.",
  "fix_diff": "--- org.apache.commons.math.linear.OpenMapRealMatrix (buggy)\n+++ org.apache.commons.math.linear.OpenMapRealMatrix (fixed)\n@@ -47,6 +47,11 @@\n      */\n     public OpenMapRealMatrix(int rowDimension, int columnDimension) {\n         super(rowDimension, columnDimension);\n+        long lRow = (long) rowDimension;\n+        long lCol = (long) columnDimension;\n+        if (lRow * lCol >= (long) Integer.MAX_VALUE) {\n+            throw new NumberIsTooLargeException(lRow * lCol, Integer.MAX_VALUE, false);\n+        }\n         this.rows = rowDimension;\n         this.columns = columnDimension;\n         this.entries = new OpenIntToDoubleHashMap(0.0);"
}